  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Circular Economy Week Nigeria (CERF25NG4I)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity supports the organisation of Circular Economy Week in Lagos in February 2026 by the Netherlands consulate-general in Lagos and the Netherlands Enterprise Agency (RVO).The week will bring together government, business, knowledge institutes and non-governmental organisations (NGOs) to develop a locally supported circular economy and waste action plan.The programme focuses on access to finance, waste management and the bioeconomy, including the launch of a new circular economy fund for Nigerian start ups and small- and medium-sized enterprises (SMEs). It will also support policy dialogue, foster partnerships between Dutch and Nigerian companies and strengthen collaboration within Nigeria&apos;s circular economy ecosystem.</narrative>
  </description>
